    "sub_name": "建設發展創新論壇",
    "sub_ename": "INNOVATION FORUM OF CONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "針對本院相關學術及科技領域，本課程邀請學界與業界之傑出學者專家進行專題演講與經驗交流，藉以提供學生擴展學術視野、瞭解實務進展與學習典範之機會。",
    "describe_eh": "On the related academic and technological fields of our college, this course invite the outstanding scholars and experts to deliver speech and experience-sharing. Through the course, the students have the chances to explore academic visions, understand current practical advances, and learn from role models.",
